{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20430","headline":"酬韩祭酒雨中见寄 · 张籍","name":"酬韩祭酒雨中见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨中愁不出，阴黑尽连宵。\n屋湿唯添漏，泥深未放朝。\n无刍怜马瘦，少食信儿娇。\n闻道韩夫子，还同此寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}